  "prefLabel": "En 702.04 Main",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 702.04 \"Main\" means a sewage pipe owned, operated, or maintained by a sewer utility which is used to transport sewage from the service pipe to the point of disposal.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
